This directory contains firmware libraries used by `joint_controller`.

Current contents:
- `CommandParser/` — serial command parsing helpers
- `DirectEncoders/` and `MagneticSensor/` — joint and encoder interfaces
- `LKM_Motor/` and `PID/` — motor protocol and control primitives
- `MT6835/` and `Utils/` — sensor support and shared utilities
- `mcp_can/` — vendored third-party CAN controller library

PlatformIO builds these libraries as part of the `joint_controller` firmware target.
